      "gender": "male",
      "english_name": "anonymous",
      "wikidata_id": "Q4233718"
    },
    "title": "高駢、薛濤",
    "poem": [
      "口，有似沒量鬥。",
      "川，有似三條椽。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_879_013_01",
